  "name": "libb2-sys",
  "description": "Low-level Rust FFI bindings and bundled source distribution for libb2, a C library implementing the BLAKE2 family of cryptographic hash functions. The project provides raw interfaces to the BLAKE2b, BLAKE2s, BLAKE2bp, and BLAKE2sp algorithms, including architecture-specific SIMD optimizations for SSE2, SSSE3, SSE4.1, AVX, and XOP.",
